"Enable or disable each quantity base shipping. <strong>Default: "
"False</strong><br/>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tApply additional rule per quantity in cart page.<br/>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Ex:</strong> 10 amount charges per 2 QTY over "
"10 QTY<br/>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIn this rule Per each 2 QTY add charges of the amount "
"of 10. But it will be apply over the 10 QTY in cart.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-info-outline\">"
